  "body": "This one year new 4 bedroom residence blends visionary architectural design with the effortless elegance of contemporary living. Crafted from the finest materials, every inch of this home is designed to celebrate comfort, style, and family.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\nMiddle level: Bask in the natural light of an expansive open-plan living area, where dining, relaxation, and family moments flow seamlessly together. Step onto the sweeping north-east facing balcony and soak in the views. The designer kitchen, features top-of-the-line appliances, elegant finishes, and space to unleash your inner chef. Enjoy the ease of internal garage access and a fully equipped laundry room—everyday tasks are a breeze in this thoughtfully designed space.\r\n\r\nUpper level: Unwind in two master suites, peaceful retreat that enjoy the views of a lush, secluded garden oasis. Here, mornings begin with birdsong and evenings end in tranquil serenity.\r\n\r\nLower level: Two beautifully appointed bedrooms, a living area, and a private bathroom with its own separate entry. Perfect for teenagers, extended family, guests, or even as an income-generating suite. Privacy and flexibility are yours to enjoy.\r\n\r\nNestled in the heart of Browns Bay, you’ll benefit from seamless access to the area’s most sought-after schooling zones—including Rangitoto College, Northcross Intermediate, Browns Bay Primary, and Murrays Bay Intermediate. With public transport and motorway connections just moments away, your daily commute will be effortless. And with both Browns Bay and Rothesay Beaches within easy walking distance, you’ll enjoy the best of coastal living all year round.\r\n\r\nLuxury, convenience, and jaw-dropping views combine to make this home truly one-of-a-kind. Don’t miss out on this rare opportunity to own a piece of paradise. Contact us today to schedule a private viewing and make this extraordinary home yours!",
